  "example": "输入 { day_master_element:\"金\", month_branch_wuxing:\"金\" } → { strength:\"strong\", favorable:[\"木\",\"水\"], unfavorable:[\"金\",\"土\"] }；listRules() 返回 R1–R14；checkConsistency() 返回空数组。"
